      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Chef Barinov finally comes to, the cooks sheepishly apologize and explain that they only locked him inside the walk-in fridge because they thought he had poisoned himself with fugu fish. Seeing how devastated he is over missing his date, Vika offers to call Elena Pavlovna and explain everything.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Шеф, клянемся, мы как лучше хотели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мы вообще думали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tanya",
      "t": "Как вы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы совершенно правы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вы простите нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tanya",
      "t": "А в этот раз не подведем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну как вы могли подумать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ну, он был добрый.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tanya",
      "t": "Не пил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Все, ладно, давайте, идите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
